{"entryType": "UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)", "primaryAccession": "Q4KMG0", "secondaryAccessions": ["O14631"], "uniProtkbId": "CDON_HUMAN", "entryAudit": {"firstPublicDate": "2006-05-02", "lastAnnotationUpdateDate": "2026-06-10", "lastSequenceUpdateDate": "2010-10-05", "entryVersion": 166, "sequenceVersion": 2}, "annotationScore": 5.0, "organism": {"scientificName": "Homo sapiens", "commonName": "Human", "taxonId": 9606, "lineage": ["Eukaryota", "Metazoa", "Chordata", "Craniata", "Vertebrata", "Euteleostomi", "Mammalia", "Eutheria", "Euarchontoglires", "Primates", "Haplorrhini", "Catarrhini", "Hominidae", "Homo"]}, "proteinExistence": "1: Evidence at protein level", "proteinDescription": {"recommendedName": {"fullName": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305"}], "value": "Cell adhesion molecule-related/down-regulated by oncogenes"}}, "flag": "Precursor"}, "genes": [{"geneName": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000303", "source": "PubMed", "id": "21802063"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000312", "source": "HGNC", "id": "HGNC:17104"}], "value": "CDON"}, "synonyms": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000303", "source": "PubMed", "id": "9214393"}], "value": "CDO"}]}], "comments": [{"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q32MD9"}], "value": "Together with BOC, forms a coreceptor required for sonic hedgehog (SHH) handoff to its patched receptor (PTCH1 or PTCH2), thereby allowing activation of the smoothened signaling pathway (By similarity). Binds to the dually lipid-modified Sonic hedgehog protein N-product (ShhN) downstream of SCUBE2 carrier and promotes its release to GAS1 (By similarity). ShhN is then directly transferred to patched receptor by GAS1 (By similarity). May also mediate cell-cell interactions between muscle precursor cells, promoting differentiation of myogenic cells (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35158"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q32MD9"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "18794898"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "20519495"}], "value": "Heterodimer; heterodimerizes with BOC to form a functional complex (By similarity). Component of a complex composed of BOC, CDON, NEO1, cadherins and CTNNB1 (By similarity). Interacts with NTN3 (By similarity). Interacts with PTCH1 (By similarity). Interacts with GAS1 (By similarity). Interacts with DHH, IHH and SHH (PubMed:18794898, PubMed:20519495)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q4KMG0", "intActId": "EBI-7016840"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P00519", "geneName": "ABL1", "intActId": "EBI-375543"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q4KMG0", "intActId": "EBI-7016840"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43323", "geneName": "DHH", "intActId": "EBI-11667804"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q4KMG0", "intActId": "EBI-7016840"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q13635", "geneName": "PTCH1", "intActId": "EBI-8775406"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q4KMG0", "intActId": "EBI-7016840"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q62226", "geneName": "Shh", "intActId": "EBI-15610166"}, "numberOfExperiments": 7, "organismDiffer": true}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35158"}], "value": "Cell membrane", "id": "SL-0039"}, "topology": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000255"}], "value": "Single-pass membrane protein", "id": "SL-9904"}}]}, {"commentType": "ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS", "events": ["Alternative splici